  <http://example.org/example> "Additional information: This feature has an irregular shape and a steepness of ~ 12 %. Minami-Tori Shima Island, also known as Marcus Island, is an isolated Japanese coral atoll in the Northwest Pacific Ocean, and the easternmost land territory of Japan. Minimum depth (m): 1084. Maximum depth (m): 5916. Total relief (m): 4832. Dimension: 80 km × 75 km"@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> "GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: Discoverer: Research vessel DSSV Pressure Drop. Year of discovery: 2020. History: Named after the Italian composer Claudio Monteverdi (1567–1643). He is considered a crucial transitional figure between the Renaissance and Baroque periods of music history and was a pioneer in the development of opera."@en ;
  <http://example.org/example> """GEBCO: discoverer and year of discovery: History: Result of a "Naming of the Mounts" contest, 1998, French Polynesia."""@en ;
